{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"X\",\"regress\":\"有，X在少数转折处对心理动机的解释比较省略，尤其S05没有Y那样明确交代为什么他此前还能装作不那么在乎。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"X\",\"point\":\"X\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"X\",\"fine\":\"X\"},\"why\":\"X的重点加亮让观众能迅速抓住每段心理变化，话语与感受交替出现、部分感受按音乐时机出现，也更容易边听边理解。水、船、光、波浪等意象贯穿始终，把从试探、沉醉、不安到接纳的过程连成一件完整的事；感受也更贴合具体的音乐变化，而不是简单罗列情绪标签。Y的完整句子在解释个别心理动机时更清楚，但右侧短词有时显得零散，音乐细节与心理感受之间的对应也不如X细腻。</escape>\"}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eb11aca7-839d-4eb6-95fd-c4492c4a997b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031923505351Z", "elapsed_seconds": 41.844, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:20:05.369136+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e735ea3a2d4c402819dc7e8088d497e62e55cc6000bc8270d8ecd9e0e554a40c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be